      "content": "the way you put it... \"the fact that you're still here is what makes it feel pointless.\" it's like i'm just stuck in this loop of existing for no reason. sometimes i wonder if the struggle is just... unnecessary. if there's no impact and no one sees me, why am i even fighting to stay part of a world that doesn't even register my presence?",
